            "review_text": "tommyngo1\n3 contributions\n0\nThe best chicken rice in Can Tho\nAug 2017 • Friends\nThis is definitely the best place for Com Ga in Can Tho. It gives me the same taste in Vietnam. I usually order Com ga with grilled meat, fried eggs. The meat is so flavorful and juicy, not dry like other places, and the portion is big as well. I know fried egg is so simple to make but somehow it does taste really good here, crispy and creamy over easy egg. The service here is pretty good, they are nice and polite, food comes out around 5 to 10 minutes and the restaurant seems clean. \nHighly recommend this place if you are a fan of com ga or looking for better dishes.\nRead more\nWritten August 27, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
