            "review_text": "geoffthompson383\nTien Giang Province, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nVery good\nAug 2017 • Family\nI like to support small businesses. This little restaurant is humbly decorated so if you're looking for ambiance, this is not the place for you. BUT if you like good tasting food at a reasonable price, you MUST try this place. In addition to the delicious food, the staff is friendly and the place is clean. My mom loved the fried chicken and rice and I enjoyed the won ton soup with noodles (#21).\nRead more\nWritten August 25, 2017",
