            "review_title": "Review at Quan An Cam Ky",
            "review_text": "Emma M\nWinchester, United Kingdom98 contributions\n0\nBasic no frills Vietnamese restaurant but great, authentic food\nApr 2017 • Couples\nMy partner chose this on a short visit to Can Tho. It was a challenge to order but lots of pointing at pictures and the Vietnamese equivalent and we got what we wanted. Only 1 person had any basis english - but don't let this put you off. It is a no frills place where we were the only non vietnamese eating, but the food was really good. It was about 8pm and they had run out of some items so go early (or for lunch) if you want the best choice.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 4, 2017",
